# Anonymous usage counts, so tiles and goals nobody uses can be found and fixed.
#
# Dormant until the line below is uncommented with the project ID from the addon's Wago
# page, with Analytics enabled there. Even then nothing leaves the machine unless the
# player installed the Wago App and turned data sharing on in it. Players keep their own
# switch in Settings, and /ls analytics prints everything Lodestar would send.
#
## X-Wago-ID: rN4kwdGD

# Embedded so Lodestar can answer keystone requests from other addons on its own.
# Guilds of WoW, Details, and anything else on LibOpenRaid read guild keys this way.
